{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an ancient deity to worship and use its power to defeat the unbelievers. Find Relics with eldritch abilities. Summon dreadful Defenders with unique traits, control the path by placing them, and combine their Benedictions to create otherworldly synergies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUMMON DEFENDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer souls to your god to draft three unique Defenders, each with a random Blessing. Choose one to summon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/75c0b39b1a664e3707e50d4ceff3072a.poster.avif?t=1759989188\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/75c0b39b1a664e3707e50d4ceff3072a.webm?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/75c0b39b1a664e3707e50d4ceff3072a.mp4?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE DEFENDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice a Defender to transfer one of its Blessings to the upgraded one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/b098183777fc052ead9000bd0f6a2d8d.poster.avif?t=1759989188\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/b098183777fc052ead9000bd0f6a2d8d.webm?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/b098183777fc052ead9000bd0f6a2d8d.mp4?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE THE PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path grows by one tile every wave, and every Defender you place influences in which direction it will grow next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/5c4ffe562315122ec75f06eb2fe50c14.poster.avif?t=1759989188\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/5c4ffe562315122ec75f06eb2fe50c14.webm?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/5c4ffe562315122ec75f06eb2fe50c14.mp4?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT RELICS OF OLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Elite Enemies to reclaim Relics crafted by the old gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/99d05c7b2ecb0a17dcf121e2b82cbf0d.poster.avif?t=1759989188\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/99d05c7b2ecb0a17dcf121e2b82cbf0d.webm?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/99d05c7b2ecb0a17dcf121e2b82cbf0d.mp4?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE UNCANNY SYNERGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some blessings and relics, when put together... break the game in beautiful ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/c99e762a924050c823b686ce13d70dd0.poster.avif?t=1759989188\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/c99e762a924050c823b686ce13d70dd0.webm?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/c99e762a924050c823b686ce13d70dd0.mp4?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[This clip is from a fairly older version, but it gives a very good idea of the stupid things that can be done so we're using it for now.]\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGE EVOLVING BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has a unique boss that will grow stronger every time you face them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[Our boss still has placeholder visuals, we'll update the description with a new .gif as soon as it is done.]</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3363550?t=1759989188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3363550?t=1759989188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/e51b5a7d418e0876c03d244e9cea344e508ce5a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759989188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/e51b5a7d418e0876c03d244e9cea344e508ce5a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759989188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an ancient deity to worship and use its power to defeat the unbelievers. Find Relics with eldritch abilities. Summon dreadful Defenders with unique traits, control the path by placing them, and combine their Benedictions to create otherworldly synergies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 