.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/5c4ffe562315122ec75f06eb2fe50c14.poster.avif?t=1759989188\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/5c4ffe562315122ec75f06eb2fe50c14.webm?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/5c4ffe562315122ec75f06eb2fe50c14.mp4?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT RELICS OF OLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Elite Enemies to reclaim Relics crafted by the old gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/99d05c7b2ecb0a17dcf121e2b82cbf0d.poster.avif?t=1759989188\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/99d05c7b2ecb0a17dcf121e2b82cbf0d.webm?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/99d05c7b2ecb0a17dcf121e2b82cbf0d.mp4?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE UNCANNY SYNERGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some blessings and relics, when put together... break the game in beautiful ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/c99e762a924050c823b686ce13d70dd0.poster.avif?t=1759989188\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/c99e762a924050c823b686ce13d70dd0.webm?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/c99e762a924050c823b686ce13d70dd0.mp4?t=1759989188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[This clip is from a fairly older version, but it gives a very good idea of the stupid things that can be done so we're using it for now.]\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGE EVOLVING BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has a unique boss that will grow stronger every time you face them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[Our boss still has placeholder visuals, we'll update the description with a new .gif as soon as it is done.]</i></p>","developers":["Erelag Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/28609467d3a4983cc2c765a73034089d329fd7c7/header.jpg?t=1759989188","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Dreadful Defenders","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video card must be 1 GB or more<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video card should be 2 GB or more<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Erelag Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":